1
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:39,120
I think

2
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,159
we're becoming more and more

3
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:41,159
like a team.

4
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:43,519
Yes.

5
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,280
I think so too.

6
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,079
Right.

7
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,480
Should we change the group name?

8
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,959
The previous group name

9
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:54,680
was "share blessings, leave when in trouble".

10
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,200
That's too superficial.

11
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,239
How about "Five blessings in the door"?

12
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:00,719
What do you think?

13
00:02:01,359 --> 00:02:02,439
That's even worse.

14
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Yibei will win!

15
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:07,879
How about that?

16
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:09,439
Straight to the point.

17
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,560
I like it.

18
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:12,400
Me too.

19
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:12,960
Sure.

20
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:13,680
I think so too.

21
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,479
Then let's go with that.

22
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:15,840
Okay.

23
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,360
Let's shout out

24
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,360
for our new group name!

25
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:18,879
Okay.

26
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:19,479
Come on.

27
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:23,080
Yibei will win!

28
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:24,800
[This retreat]

29
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,120
[has changed everyone a lot.]

30
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,240
[Now the basketball club]

31
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,879
[is truly formed.]

32
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,599
[I don't even have the energy to take a photo.]

33
00:02:34,599 --> 00:02:35,120
Let's go.

34
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:37,000
Gu Chenyang,

35
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:37,759
are you hungry?

36
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,919
Mom, I'm back.

37
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,159
Mom.

38
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,919
My son is back.

39
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,400
Welcome home.

40
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:37,280
Your dad has been asking about you.

41
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,840
Luckily, I got the news

42
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,000
that your middle school

43
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:40,960
is holding Olympiad training.

44
00:03:41,599 --> 00:03:42,360
I told him

45
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,719
you were working as a teaching assistant.

46
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,439
I even retouched

47
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,520
a few photos for him.

48
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,280
Thank you, mom.

49
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,680
Mom, what are you writing this afternoon?

50
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,039
Your school

51
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:55,719
is having a reading week, right?

52
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,000
I have to speak at the PTA meeting.

53
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,319
I'm writing my speech.

54
00:04:00,039 --> 00:04:01,080
You've worked hard, mom.

55
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,960
Why are you so grumpy?

56
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,199
Don't be so polite to your mom.

57
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,439
Am I really so grumpy?

58
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:17,600
I shouldn't have said grumpy.

59
00:04:19,439 --> 00:04:21,319
You should be composed and considerate.

60
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,160
Besides,

61
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,120
who says kids

62
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,399
have to be carefree

63
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,639
and giggly?

64
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,720
Smile.

65
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,600
Smile.

66
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,959
You look so pretty.

67
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,120
This camp

68
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,680
is really something.

69
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:49,399
When did you ever

70
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,879
care about this?

71
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,680
It's okay.

72
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:53,439
No.

73
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,079
I have to write

74
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,759
a long review for them.

75
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,720
Let me take a picture.

76
00:04:59,000 --> 00:04:59,839
Mom.

77
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,360
Don't be shy

78
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,560
with me.

79
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,959
Then stand a bit farther away.

80
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:04,560
Right.

81
00:05:04,879 --> 00:05:06,360
Turn on the beauty camera.

82
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,120
You're handsome even without it.

83
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:09,519
Give me a peace sign.

84
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,079
And show your pearly whites.

85
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:14,319
So good-looking.

86
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:18,000
Help me out here.

87
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,800
How should I write this review?

88
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:23,680
Rehabilitation training.

89
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,800
The base you went to

90
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,000
is very professional.

91
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,360
Many professional athletes

92
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:30,120
go there for rehabilitation.

93
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,759
Is that okay?

94
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,720
Mom, I haven't eaten since I got back.

95
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:38,079
Oh right.

96
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,680
I'm so forgetful.

97
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,480
Wait a minute.

98
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,439
I'll go prepare it right away.

99
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,480
How about spaghetti?

100
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:44,319
Okay.

101
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,319
Okay.

102
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:07,959
Zhou Yang,

103
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,240
I heard that the Basketball Club

104
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,439
went out for team building during the National Day holiday.

105
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:14,319
It wasn't team building.

106
00:06:14,639 --> 00:06:16,920
We went out for joint training.

107
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:18,800
Joint training?

108
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:19,920
Yes.

109
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:25,639
It's good to be positive.

110
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:27,959
But you are the President of the Student Union.

111
00:06:27,959 --> 00:06:29,560
You should keep a balance.

112
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,120
You can't be led astray.

113
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:31,800
Do you know?

114
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:34,800
Do you mean

115
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,639
they are too hard

116
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:36,959
in training?

117
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:39,439
During the training,

118
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:41,160
they get up at six o'clock every day to train.

119
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,040
Except for eating and sleeping,

120
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,199
they are playing basketball.

121
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,800
If this is called going astray,

122
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,920
then I think

123
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,680
other clubs

124
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,839
should be led.

125
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,839
All right, all right.

126
00:06:55,839 --> 00:06:57,319
It's good to be flexible.

127
00:06:58,839 --> 00:07:00,360
Then this plan of the arts festival...

128
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,319
Plan of the arts festival.

129
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:05,279
Then go on

130
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,680
with this plan.

131
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:07,360
Okay.

132
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:08,560
Thank you, sir.

133
00:07:12,199 --> 00:07:12,959
Anything else?

134
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,199
No.

135
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,399
Goodbye, sir.

136
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,160
Go ahead.

137
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,000
Zhou Yang.

138
00:07:38,399 --> 00:07:39,199
What's up?

139
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:40,800
Nothing.

140
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,879
I just want to know

141
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,199
why Fu Binyan

142
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:44,519
quitted the team.

143
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:48,519
I don't know

144
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,000
the details.

145
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,920
I didn't go to the competition

146
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,759
because of something urgent.

147
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,399
Soon after, I heard that Fu Binyan

148
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:57,759
had a bad cold.

149
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,199
I asked him about it,

150
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,519
but he didn't say much.

151
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,639
Later,

152
00:08:03,639 --> 00:08:05,240
at the beginning of the new term,

153
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:07,279
he said he would

154
00:08:07,959 --> 00:08:09,160
never play basketball again.

155
00:08:10,519 --> 00:08:11,639
I see.

156
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:12,720
You...

157
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:14,800
Why are you suddenly interested in this?

158
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:18,120
Nothing. I just want to know.

159
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,439
Why are you laughing?

160
00:08:19,879 --> 00:08:21,240
I have something to tell you.

161
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:23,000
I met Fu Binyan

162
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,079
in the bathroom.

163
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,480
I invited him to come and play later.

164
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,360
He agreed.

165
00:08:28,319 --> 00:08:29,720
No, he refused.

166
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,399
Then why are you laughing so happily?

167
00:08:31,399 --> 00:08:33,039
He was very nice today.

168
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,360
Come on, you ask me.

169
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:34,919
Do you want to

170
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:35,799
go to the basketball club later?

171
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,120
No, I have something to do.

172
00:08:39,279 --> 00:08:40,919
He never used to be like this.

173
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:41,919
Yeah.

174
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:42,600
I also think

175
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,840
his attitude has improved recently.

176
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:44,919
He even helped me

177
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,919
fix my game console last time.

178
00:08:45,919 --> 00:08:46,679
Next time I see him,

179
00:08:46,679 --> 00:08:47,799
I must have dinner with him.

180
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,320
Yes, we must treat him to dinner.

181
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:51,559
Last time in the infirmary,

182
00:08:51,559 --> 00:08:53,159
if it weren't for him comforting me,

183
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,279
I might have really quit the club.

184
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:55,519
Infirmary?

185
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:56,320
Yes.

186
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,039
It was during the training camp.

187
00:08:59,080 --> 00:08:59,919
Enough.

188
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,440
Instead of discussing others here,

189
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,639
you'd better go to training quickly.

190
00:09:02,639 --> 00:09:03,240
Let's go.

191
00:10:09,919 --> 00:10:11,000
Hello, mom.

192
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:12,519
I'm fine.

193
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,080
I just took a walk.

194
00:10:15,399 --> 00:10:16,720
I walked a little fast.

195
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:18,919
Don't worry.

196
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:32,639
You still dare to play basketball?

197
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:34,759
Why not?

198
00:10:36,759 --> 00:10:39,639
Can people with heart disease play basketball?

199
00:10:44,759 --> 00:10:45,879
I don't know what you're talking about.

200
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,320
You went to the training base

201
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,759
for rehabilitation training, right?

202
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,639
I looked it up.

203
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,279
It's the most

204
00:10:57,279 --> 00:10:58,559
professional rehab center in Yibei,

205
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:01,080
specializing in cardiopulmonary and neurological rehab.

206
00:11:02,399 --> 00:11:04,039
Zhou Yang said you left the team

207
00:11:04,039 --> 00:11:05,320
because of a severe cold.

208
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,679
Cold

209
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:08,360
is one of the triggers

210
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,519
for immune-mediated heart disease.

211
00:11:13,519 --> 00:11:14,240
Gu Chenyang,

212
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:17,320
you don't have time to study tactics,

213
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,240
but you have time

214
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,360
to study my medical records?

215
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,120
Don't tell anyone.

216
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,679
Okay.

217
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:49,759
Wait.

218
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,519
There are many ways to

219
00:11:56,519 --> 00:11:57,320
get back on the court,

220
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,879
not just by playing basketball.

221
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,840
Tomorrow is our first game

222
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,519
of the group stage.

223
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,519
If you can come,

224
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:05,399
our team will welcome you.

225
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:49,559
This is

226
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:51,559
the live broadcast of Group A

227
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:54,799
of the Xuhai Competition Area

228
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:55,679
of the National High School Boys Basketball League.

229
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:56,720
Today's opponents

230
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,720
are Yibei Middle School Basketball Team

231
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:00,759
and Wenshan No.6 Middle School Basketball Team.

232
00:13:00,759 --> 00:13:02,600
The current score is seven to three.

233
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,240
[Yibei Middle School is temporarily in the lead.]

234
00:13:05,519 --> 00:13:06,720
Nice pass!

235
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,320
Go Yibei!

236
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,039
[Lin Qingyuan,]

237
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:10,759
[No. 77 from Yibei Middle School,]

238
00:13:10,759 --> 00:13:12,559
[is really on fire today.]

239
00:13:13,279 --> 00:13:14,000
One, one!

240
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:36,000
No. 7 from the blue team

241
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:37,080
committed a foul.

242
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,799
Two points and one free throw.

243
00:13:42,639 --> 00:13:44,279
Yibei, keep it up!

244
00:13:44,519 --> 00:13:45,879
Yibei, keep it up!

245
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,559
Yibei, keep it up!

246
00:13:47,799 --> 00:13:49,639
Yibei, keep it up!

247
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:50,399
I can't do this anymore.

248
00:13:50,399 --> 00:13:52,480
[Wenshan starts to closely guard Lin Qingyuan,]

249
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:53,919
[but]

250
00:13:54,559 --> 00:13:55,720
[Yibei's firepower]

251
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,600
[is still too strong.]

252
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:59,919
[Gu Chenyang, Zhou Yang, and Li Haoyu,]

253
00:14:00,159 --> 00:14:01,879
[they're scoring from all sides.]

254
00:14:02,639 --> 00:14:05,000
[Wenshan will have to come up with more.]

255
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:14,200
[No. 18 Xu Anbo]

256
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,159
[also stepped up,]

257
00:14:15,159 --> 00:14:17,320
[reviving the team's offense.]

258
00:14:17,879 --> 00:14:20,279
[No. 50 Li Haoyu is also playing better.]

259
00:14:20,279 --> 00:14:21,759
[He's playing very steadily today,]

260
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:22,720
[with few mistakes.]

261
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:25,679
[Of course, Wenshan hasn't given up yet.]

262
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,360
Wenshan!

263
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,320
Defense!

264
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,600
Wenshan, keep it up!

265
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,639
We've got the rebound!

266
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,200
Come on!

267
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:58,000
Yibei, keep it up!

268
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:01,080
[Students, it's crunch time.]

269
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,200
[Yibei Middle School]

270
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:04,080
[has built up a lead]

271
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,639
[in the first half.]

272
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:07,440
[But Wenshan No. 6 Middle School]

273
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,720
[has shown remarkable resilience,]

274
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:12,559
[chasing after the score.]

275
00:15:19,399 --> 00:15:20,639
Defense!

276
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:44,320
[Now both teams]

277
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:46,840
[are back to the same starting line.]

278
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:50,600
[The score is 57 to 57.]

279
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,639
[The last 30 seconds.]

280
00:15:52,639 --> 00:15:54,840
[Let's hold our breath]

281
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:57,200
[and focus on the game.]

282
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:06,039
It's intercepted.

283
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:07,320
Li Haoyu intercepted it.

284
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:48,279
[Let's congratulate]

285
00:16:48,279 --> 00:16:49,600
[Yibei High School Basketball Team]

286
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,960
[on their first victory.]

287
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,919
[This brand new team]

288
00:16:52,919 --> 00:16:54,399
[has announced their arrival]

289
00:16:54,399 --> 00:16:56,000
[with a team victory.]

290
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,720
[The story of this team]

291
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,559
[has just begun.]

292
00:17:21,559 --> 00:17:22,720
Let's take a photo together.

293
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,000
It's so memorable.

294
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:24,680
Okay.

295
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,359
Awesome.

296
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,680
The last shot was so cool.

297
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,119
I'm proud of you.

298
00:17:38,119 --> 00:17:39,200
I never thought

299
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,319
I could do it.

300
00:17:41,359 --> 00:17:42,200
Captain,

301
00:17:42,599 --> 00:17:44,119
I did well today, right?

302
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,400
Look at me.

303
00:17:49,079 --> 00:17:51,160
Three, two...

304
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:51,839
Wait.

305
00:17:53,559 --> 00:17:54,640
You should be in the photo too.

306
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,880
It's not a group photo without you.

307
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:56,640
I'll take it.

308
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:57,480
Thank you, coach.

309
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,119
Come on.

310
00:18:01,599 --> 00:18:04,119
Three, two, one.

311
00:18:04,119 --> 00:18:05,559
Yibei

312
00:18:05,559 --> 00:18:08,079
will win!

313
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,119
Why not choose this one?

314
00:18:18,079 --> 00:18:19,640
Isn't this a pretty good shot?

315
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,559
You call this good?

316
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,519
This is the highlight of my life?

317
00:18:22,519 --> 00:18:23,160
This is it?

318
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,319
This must be

319
00:18:24,319 --> 00:18:25,519
the "submarine" who picked this picture.

320
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,720
Otherwise, why are we two

321
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,359
like we're meme characters?

322
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,079
Director Qian.

323
00:18:33,319 --> 00:18:34,160
Hello, Director Qian.

324
00:18:35,599 --> 00:18:36,839
Hello, Director Qian.

325
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:49,480
You guys are really good at basketball.

326
00:18:51,079 --> 00:18:52,640
You've shown the spirit

327
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:53,519
of Yibei Middle School.

328
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,200
But,

329
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,880
just being good at basketball

330
00:18:56,880 --> 00:18:58,160
isn't enough.

331
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:00,400
You need to excel in all areas,

332
00:19:01,319 --> 00:19:02,880
especially the two of you.

333
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:05,480
Show improvement in your next exam,

334
00:19:05,759 --> 00:19:06,680
and I'll put you

335
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,119
on the honor roll again.

336
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,720
No need.

337
00:19:10,119 --> 00:19:11,240
No, no,

338
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,640
we'll keep working hard.

339
00:19:13,119 --> 00:19:13,960
That rhymes!

340
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,160
See you, sir.

341
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:19,359
Okay, keep going.

342
00:19:19,359 --> 00:19:20,559
I have confidence in you.

343
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:23,880
Keep it up

344
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,359
and make more achievements.

345
00:19:38,039 --> 00:19:38,640
Good.

346
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:39,119
Well done.

347
00:19:39,119 --> 00:19:39,799
You are amazing.

348
00:19:39,799 --> 00:19:40,640
This ball is really good.

349
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,599
You just won a game.

350
00:19:43,319 --> 00:19:44,519
Is it worth being so happy for so long?

351
00:19:47,519 --> 00:19:48,680
The provincial tournament

352
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,680
is a round-robin

353
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:50,720
of four teams.

354
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,880
You've only won one game

355
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,200
against Wenshan No. 6 Middle School,

356
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,720
a team that just formed last year

357
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:57,119
and isn't very strong.

358
00:19:57,599 --> 00:19:58,960
Besides, they brought in

359
00:19:59,319 --> 00:20:00,039
three freshmen

360
00:20:00,039 --> 00:20:01,240
in the game,

361
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,400
clearly just training them.

362
00:20:04,559 --> 00:20:05,480
Your group

363
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:06,599
has two teams left.

364
00:20:06,599 --> 00:20:08,839
Fanghe No.3 Middle School was in the top eight last year.

365
00:20:09,599 --> 00:20:11,440
They have the highest average number of fouls.

366
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:12,960
They like physical confrontation.

367
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:16,440
Then there's the Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education.

368
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:18,000
They were the champion last year.

369
00:20:18,799 --> 00:20:20,160
They are especially good at fast breaks.

370
00:20:20,599 --> 00:20:21,759
They have the highest half-court score.

371
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:26,799
Your tough battle hasn't even started yet.

372
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,079
Well,

373
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:31,119
Senior Fu Da,

374
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,880
do you come here

375
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:33,720
just to

376
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:34,759
beat us?

377
00:20:36,279 --> 00:20:37,720
Do you think I want to come here?

378
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,319
Director Qian asked you

379
00:20:39,519 --> 00:20:40,440
to be all-round,

380
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:42,039
so I was sent here.

381
00:20:42,759 --> 00:20:44,119
That means you are

382
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,160
spying on us.

383
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:47,480
You can understand it in this way.

384
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:48,839
We should play basketball

385
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:50,400
and study at the same time.

386
00:20:51,599 --> 00:20:52,480
It's good that you are here.

387
00:20:58,599 --> 00:20:59,839
We are in trouble again.

388
00:21:00,119 --> 00:21:01,640
Chi Jia, you say it.

389
00:21:02,519 --> 00:21:04,119
I'll be short.

390
00:21:04,559 --> 00:21:05,839
The cost of the National Day training camp

391
00:21:05,839 --> 00:21:06,799
exceeds the budget.

392
00:21:06,799 --> 00:21:07,960
Our club

393
00:21:08,519 --> 00:21:09,440
is running out of money.

394
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:12,119
What?

395
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:15,079
How much do we need? I'll pay.

396
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:16,119
No.

397
00:21:16,119 --> 00:21:17,799
That will change the nature of the club.

398
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:22,599
But there's a way.

399
00:21:24,599 --> 00:21:26,480
You mean the Arts Festival?

400
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:29,400
There's a group talent competition

401
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,039
at the Arts Festival at the end of this month.

402
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:32,240
The first place will get a prize.

403
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:33,960
You should have told us earlier.

404
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,240
Talent competition?

405
00:21:35,599 --> 00:21:37,160
Leave it to me.

406
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:38,880
Don't worry.

407
00:21:40,039 --> 00:21:40,599
Good.

408
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:46,680
Dad.

409
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:52,680
I know. I'll handle it.

410
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:53,519
Wait for me.

411
00:21:55,319 --> 00:21:56,160
You're back.

412
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,440
Why are you home today?

413
00:21:57,759 --> 00:21:58,839
The noodles at the restaurant near school

414
00:21:58,839 --> 00:21:59,559
are super delicious.

415
00:21:59,559 --> 00:22:00,359
Would you like to try some?

416
00:22:01,039 --> 00:22:01,799
I have some work to do at the office.

417
00:22:01,799 --> 00:22:02,720
I'll skip the meal for now.

418
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:04,960
Stir-fried rice noodles?

419
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,839
I can make them for you.

420
00:22:07,799 --> 00:22:08,400
Okay.

421
00:22:10,079 --> 00:22:11,079
Have something nice.

422
00:22:14,039 --> 00:22:14,839
Thank you, Mr. Li.

423
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:15,799
Awesome.

424
00:22:19,079 --> 00:22:20,279
If you add another zero to my bonus,

425
00:22:20,279 --> 00:22:21,799
I could even afford a Manchu-Han Imperial Feast.

426
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:36,680
Got it, I'll handle it.

427
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:37,960
Wait for me.

428
00:22:49,279 --> 00:22:49,759
Then I guess

429
00:22:49,759 --> 00:22:51,799
I'll just enjoy the feast myself.

430
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:03,400
Yummy.

431
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:11,759
Pulsar Band

432
00:23:11,759 --> 00:23:13,319
is going to perform at the Arts Festival.

433
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:15,599
Join us? Join us? Join us?

434
00:23:22,599 --> 00:23:24,000
Yu, spare me.

435
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:25,839
My mom's making me memorize vocabulary.

436
00:23:25,839 --> 00:23:26,640
I have to go.

437
00:23:28,559 --> 00:23:29,440
I won't go.

438
00:23:29,519 --> 00:23:30,880
I was caught going to the internet bar with you last time.

439
00:23:31,039 --> 00:23:32,240
My legs were almost broken.

440
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:33,839
I need to be a new person.

441
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:36,119
A new person?

442
00:23:36,599 --> 00:23:37,240
You are still

443
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:38,240
the same.

444
00:23:40,039 --> 00:23:41,240
Brother Yu, I dare not.

445
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:45,839
A bunch of wimps.

446
00:23:58,519 --> 00:23:59,279
Rock and roll!

447
00:23:59,519 --> 00:24:00,319
Awesome!

448
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:11,160
Now the game has come to

449
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:12,000
the final moment.

450
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:13,559
Li Haoyu

451
00:24:13,559 --> 00:24:15,319
faced a three-man defense.

452
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:16,559
He turned,

453
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:17,759
jumped,

454
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:18,599
and layup.

455
00:24:18,599 --> 00:24:21,440
The ball went in, awesome!

456
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,240
Boring.

457
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,440
Tell me.

458
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:01,400
Fu Binyan,

459
00:25:01,759 --> 00:25:03,839
is there something

460
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:05,640
you haven't told me?

461
00:25:09,559 --> 00:25:10,480
Why do you ask?

462
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,000
No reason.

463
00:25:14,160 --> 00:25:15,319
I just have a feeling.

464
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,880
Then you're wrong this time.

465
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:32,599
Hurry up.

466
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,400
Pulsar Band is recruiting members.

467
00:25:34,599 --> 00:25:36,599
Good pay. PM me if interested.

468
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:42,400
You again?

469
00:25:47,359 --> 00:25:49,039
We're a team.

470
00:25:49,079 --> 00:25:50,279
It's only right.

471
00:25:57,559 --> 00:25:58,960
Why are you in my space?

472
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:00,680
We're a team.

473
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:01,839
The band's

474
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:03,079
our concern.

475
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:04,680
Exactly.

476
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,680
There's strength in numbers.

477
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:08,279
You're the drummer,

478
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,519
Gu Chenyang's on keyboards,

479
00:26:10,039 --> 00:26:11,039
and Lin Qingyuan can play bass.

480
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:12,559
We're just missing

481
00:26:12,559 --> 00:26:13,559
a guitarist,

482
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,559
and we've already found

483
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:16,920
the best candidate for you.

484
00:26:17,359 --> 00:26:18,240
Who is it?

485
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,000
How's their skill level?

486
00:26:19,559 --> 00:26:20,799
Just go and listen for yourself.

487
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:25,119
They're pretty good!

488
00:26:25,599 --> 00:26:26,519
Where did you find them?
